{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "main_9_level_st_09-03",
  "groupId": "main_9",
  "stageId": "st_09-03",
  "title": "臨近的暴風",
  "storyCode": "9-20",
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_st_09-03.txt",
  "sourceHash": "c4b881d3f22006f1080899217648d76cc67a529bd7fb6da83473a8399af060ec",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misery",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_235",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......都給我吧。為了把她送回來，你趕了一路，很辛苦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misery",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_235",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "下面的事，我親自處理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "遺物和骨灰匣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "切爾諾伯格事件結束後，類似的緊急通訊聲已經有整整十一個月又二十七天沒有在羅德島的甲板上響起了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "——這一次犧牲的是誰？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misery",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_235",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Outcast。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "我看到了，你手中握著的是她的彈巢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "雖然不想承認，但在來的路上，我已經想過這個答案。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "我曾經和她打過一個賭——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "現在看來，她還是贏了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misery",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_235",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "凱爾希，下面的會議，我會缺席。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misery",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_235",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "按照慣例，精英幹員的葬禮將由你親自主持......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misery",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_235",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但這次，我希望由我來告別她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "......我想沒有人會有異議，包括她自己。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misery",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_235",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "既然會議中止，那麼，我會在這裡給出我最終的選擇——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "Misery，我知道你的答案。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misery",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_235",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那你肯定也知道其他人的答案。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misery",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_235",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "情況發生了變化。沒人喜歡這個變化，但大家都清楚只能這麼選。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misery",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_235",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——我們必須儘快進入倫蒂尼姆。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "你們都很清楚，我的立場始終如一——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "但無論你們最終是否決定支持我的提議，我都必須強調，羅德島並不會為了宣洩任何私人情感而決定未來的航向。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misery",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_235",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你是在提醒我，不要想著為Outcast報仇？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misery",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_235",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你放心。我的內心是充滿了悲痛和憤怒，可我還記得自己的職責。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misery",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_235",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只是，我要親眼看一看能殺死Outcast的究竟是什麼——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misery",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_235",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那不會是一個人，或者幾個人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misery",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_235",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "凱爾希......假如我們不去尋找真相，那麼籠罩著倫蒂尼姆乃至整個維多利亞的陰雲只會更加肆無忌憚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misery",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_235",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "到時候，不止Outcast......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misery",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_235",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我會死，我們都會。沒有人能逃脫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misery",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_235",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就像你說的，羅德島不會為了死者復仇......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misery",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_235",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但是，我們都想為生者創造繼續活下去的機會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_479_sleach_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呃......這是什麼地方？我是不是又走錯路了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_479_sleach_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "糟糕，快到約好的時間了，我得快點走......唉，奧利弗叔叔怎麼沒說過，這艘船有這麼大呀！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerToken": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_479_sleach_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "咦，你是......？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_479_sleach_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "等等，請、請等一下！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerToken": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_479_sleach_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_479_sleach_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（為什麼她看起來就像完全不認識我？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_479_sleach_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（不，我不可能認錯人。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_479_sleach_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（上船之後，好幾次想找人問問她怎麼樣了，但他們都要嘛不知道，要嘛不告訴我。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_479_sleach_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（唔......為了她的安全，也許這是更妥當的做法？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_479_sleach_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......你好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_479_sleach_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你......你是在這裡看書嗎？這本《騎士艾凡赫傳奇》......我也看過，而且很喜歡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_479_sleach_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "書裡描寫的那段維多利亞歷史很有趣，不是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerToken": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "有趣......嗎？還好......但不是真的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerToken": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "小說......就只是小說而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_479_sleach_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯......這麼說也沒錯。你還想看其他小說嗎？我有好多......呃，對不起，我忘了自己都沒帶出來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerToken": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你喜歡這本......可以送給你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_479_sleach_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "欸，這樣好嗎？謝、謝謝......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerToken": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_479_sleach_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊好的，再見！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_479_sleach_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（......還能再見嗎？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_479_sleach_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（她手裡的另一本書是......詩集？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_479_sleach_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "西莫·威廉姆斯......作者姓名和封面都好眼熟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_479_sleach_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "約好的地方......就是這裡了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_479_sleach_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "識、識別碼？那是什麼東西？《新幹員指引》裡有寫嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_479_sleach_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呃，馬上就要遲到了，還是先敲下門試試吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_479_sleach_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "請進來吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_479_sleach_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "下午好，薇洛小姐......還是應該叫你幹員琴柳？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊......阿米婭小姐！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "請和大家一樣叫我阿米婭吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "真是不好意思......阿米婭這麼忙，還要抽時間來見我。前兩天體檢的時候，亞葉小姐說你一天只休息五個小時......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "亞葉姐姐總是很擔心我的身體。不過沒關係，我最近的健康狀況很不錯，而且我也一直很想再見見你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......這裡就是Outcast以前的辦公室？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯。其實她並沒有在這裡待很久，出事前兩個月，我們剛剛說服她接受了崗位調動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "她和我說過，在來小丘郡之前，她已經差不多半退休了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但她依然堅持申請去執行這次任務。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我時常回想她在那幾天說的每一句話......我相信她早就做好了面對一切的準備。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Outcast確實是這樣的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "即便是在精英幹員中，Outcast的性格都稱得上特別——她總能輕鬆地做出一些普通人眼裡很艱難的決定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是啊，她說......她曾經因為一次戰爭中的失敗調停，放棄了教會裡很高的職位。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唔......離開拉特蘭教會的部分確有其事，但是失敗的調停？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我不記得Outcast的檔案裡有這項記載，反而，這聽起來很像Misery的一件往事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈......哈哈......不知道為什麼，這很像她會做的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可能有些人會因此覺得Outcast不夠真誠......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，即便你告訴我，她說的並不全是實話，她仍是我見過最真誠的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你真的這麼想？嗯......我並不是很意外，畢竟Outcast看人的眼光從不出錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "阿米婭，我理解你的時間很寶貴......但你願不願意再多跟我說一些她的故事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "當然。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只是，這故事會很長——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只要你有空，我隨時想聽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好啊，我相信......去倫蒂尼姆的路上，我們會有很多時間的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "數月後"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "到底修好了沒啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "別著急嘛，這鎮子太荒了，要找到個能給發報機用的替換線圈很不容易......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "還是我來吧。你這輕輕一碰設備就冒煙的問題，看來根本沒好轉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "本來這安全屋也很久沒人用了嘛......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "說到底，我就不該聽你的走這條路線。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "這幾個月兜兜轉轉，一半時間都在沒人煙的地方吃沙！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "幾年沒見，陳陳你怎麼瞪起人來更凶了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "......別嘟囔了，根本不夠小聲，我都聽得見。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "你問我為什麼著急？我還納悶你怎麼不急！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "這一趟出來多久了，別說鬼魂部隊，我們連個像樣的線索都沒找到！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "換作我還在龍門當警察的時候，遇到這種情況，我都想叫你趕緊死心......沒什麼人質能撐這麼久。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#8",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......不。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#8",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我知道隊長一定還活著。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#8",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "同樣的，她知道我會想辦法救她，她也會想盡辦法來和我會合。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "唉。算了算了，我真是拿你沒辦法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "要是能說服你，我至於被你拽著到處跑這麼久？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#9",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那當然是因為......陳陳你一直都對我這麼好！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "行了，你的執著，我不是不明白。那些年，我滿心想著找那個人的時候，你也始終支持著我......算了，眼下不提這個。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "——總之，你也都聽到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "小丘郡事件對外宣稱早有定論，就是一場軍隊演習事故。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "所有受傷和生病的平民都得到了賠償和安置——至少政府文件裡就是這麼寫的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "深池，或者說鬼魂部隊，無論在你離開時候他們是不是佔領了小丘郡，現在看起來都已經悄無聲息地撤離了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "這一點，就算我們回去親眼確認，也不會改變。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#8",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我同意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但我還記得我看見的全部。我相信，再怎麼貌似平靜，小丘郡內部......以及周圍很多城市裡，都還是發生了很大的變化。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而且......一想到這些變化在眾目睽睽之下被藏得這麼好，陳陳你不覺得更恐怖了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果敵人在鬧出了這麼大動靜之後選擇了再次蟄伏，那只能說明，他們背後還有更大的圖謀！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在維多利亞......隨時都會有比小丘郡更大的危機被引爆。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "我信你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "......所以我在這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "但我沒有把握還有多少人會信你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這就是為什麼我們要繼續努力！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "這麼看，我們還是得想辦法進入大城市。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "你還記得休斯吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那個......胖胖的訓練時候總是摔得滿頭包的男同學？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "......人家已經是千貿城商業聯盟的副主席。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "他的話，是我們這幫同學裡，最有可能獲知一些被刻意藏起來的資訊的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "其實，在陳陳你說之前，我早就想過去找休斯......不，不光休斯，我還想試試看找大個子格林，紅頭髮比爾......找大家幫忙！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這些事，我一個人也試過，可是很難辦到......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#8",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但是現在，我身邊有你，還有一路上羅德島的大家慷慨提供的物資和資訊支援——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我感覺充滿了希望！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "我還是得先提醒你，我沒把握他們能否被說服——啊？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "你*維多利亞問候語*幹什麼啊突然這麼大力拉我！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "陳陳，發報機亮了欸！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "......是羅德島的緊急電訊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "發報機壞了之前，他們才剛收到我們發出去的定位消息吧？難道說羅德島一直在找我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "........."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怎麼啦？你的臉色就像剛才收到的資訊給你來了一整套拳......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呃，我好像看懂了......又是關於她的消息？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "......你猜得沒錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "接下來的事，我需要好好想一想。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_237",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "潔西卡，任務進行得怎麼樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_237",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯，我在路上了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_237",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不能放鬆警惕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_237",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "放心吧，雷蛇前輩......雖然我沒怎麼回過維多利亞，但是我們的飛行器已經獲得了出入許可，導航系統也在正常運作中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_237",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這次護送僑民回哥倫比亞的任務說難不難，但隨時可能生變。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_237",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "僑民給我們發信的時候，我還是有點驚訝的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_237",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這一路上都還算風平浪靜，情況真、真的已經那麼嚴重了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_237",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呼......抱歉，在隊長和隊員們面前不太好表現出來，可我確實還是有點緊張。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_237",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......你的隊長不在？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_237",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呃，是的，在到維多利亞之後不久，她就帶著一部分人走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_237",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "有可能......是有別的任務？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_237",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......撤僑行動被委託給了你們裝備與應用技術部門，這顯然是有原因的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_237",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "顯、顯然嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_237",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你沒發現，未嘗不是好事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_237",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "難道說......他們還在和別人談合作？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_237",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可我們並未收到任何維多利亞官方的訂單......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_237",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......按照保密協定，我不該對跨部門的資訊進行猜測或評論。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_237",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "請把我的這些話忘掉吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_237",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "專注你的任務，有什麼情況，隨時和我聯絡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_237",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "記住，這次雖然是黑鋼接的任務，但我們和羅德島的合作依然有效。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_237",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯，我明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_237",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "等羅德島的幾支小隊也順利靠近倫蒂尼姆，在必要的時候我會和他們互相接應。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerToken": "char_112_seige_1",
      "operatorId": "char_112_seige",
      "portraitKey": "char_112_seige",
      "text": "......越來越近了啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "維娜，你很緊張？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "推進之王",
              "speakerToken": "char_112_seige_1",
              "operatorId": "char_112_seige",
              "portraitKey": "char_112_seige",
              "text": "幾個月前，凱爾希醫生問我是否準備好了。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "推進之王",
              "speakerToken": "char_112_seige_1",
              "operatorId": "char_112_seige",
              "portraitKey": "char_112_seige",
              "text": "......我的回答是，我不知道。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "推進之王",
              "speakerToken": "char_112_seige_1",
              "operatorId": "char_112_seige",
              "portraitKey": "char_112_seige",
              "text": "而到了這時候......我依舊不知道。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "推進之王",
              "speakerToken": "char_112_seige_1",
              "operatorId": "char_112_seige",
              "portraitKey": "char_112_seige",
              "text": "所以，我很難說自己不緊張。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "推進之王",
              "speakerToken": "char_112_seige_1",
              "operatorId": "char_112_seige",
              "portraitKey": "char_112_seige",
              "text": "博士，謝謝你在這裡陪我。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "推進之王",
              "speakerToken": "char_112_seige_1",
              "operatorId": "char_112_seige",
              "portraitKey": "char_112_seige",
              "text": "如果我還在貪圖你身邊的這份清靜......我是不是顯得太逃避了？"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "這一天我們都等了很久。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "推進之王",
              "speakerToken": "char_112_seige_1",
              "operatorId": "char_112_seige",
              "portraitKey": "char_112_seige",
              "text": "是啊，從我逃出來的那一天起，我就在等著回去的這一天。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "推進之王",
          "speakerToken": "char_112_seige_1",
          "operatorId": "char_112_seige",
          "portraitKey": "char_112_seige",
          "text": "博士，我忍不住想，如果一個人離開他原本所屬的環境太久，他真的還有家可回嗎？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "醒來的時候，我都不記得自己離開了多久。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "推進之王",
              "speakerToken": "char_112_seige_1",
              "operatorId": "char_112_seige",
              "portraitKey": "char_112_seige",
              "text": "我聽你說起過那段日子。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "推進之王",
              "speakerToken": "char_112_seige_1",
              "operatorId": "char_112_seige",
              "portraitKey": "char_112_seige",
              "text": "博士，你剛醒沒多久，就不得不站在指揮的位置上，經歷了切爾諾伯格那麼嚴重的事件......幾乎沒人能夠做到像你一樣。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "阿米婭和大家都接納了我。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "推進之王",
              "speakerToken": "char_112_seige_1",
              "operatorId": "char_112_seige",
              "portraitKey": "char_112_seige",
              "text": "阿米婭......博士，你對阿米婭來說，是真正的家人。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "推進之王",
          "speakerToken": "char_112_seige_1",
          "operatorId": "char_112_seige",
          "portraitKey": "char_112_seige",
          "text": "羅德島需要你，我們這些幹員也都需要你，這一點毋庸置疑。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "在倫蒂尼姆，也有人等著你。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "推進之王",
          "speakerToken": "char_112_seige_1",
          "operatorId": "char_112_seige",
          "portraitKey": "char_112_seige",
          "text": "格拉斯哥幫。他們一定有了新的頭領，否則，他們無法在倫蒂尼姆立足。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "推進之王",
          "speakerToken": "char_112_seige_1",
          "operatorId": "char_112_seige",
          "portraitKey": "char_112_seige",
          "text": "至於其他人......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "推進之王",
          "speakerToken": "char_112_seige_1",
          "operatorId": "char_112_seige",
          "portraitKey": "char_112_seige",
          "text": "我相信我離開這麼久，倫蒂尼姆壓根就不會少掉一枚釘子。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "想知道答案的話，就只能一起往前了。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "推進之王",
          "speakerToken": "char_112_seige_1",
          "operatorId": "char_112_seige",
          "portraitKey": "char_112_seige",
          "text": "博士，你說過......你也想去倫蒂尼姆尋找真相。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "推進之王",
          "speakerToken": "char_112_seige_1",
          "operatorId": "char_112_seige",
          "portraitKey": "char_112_seige",
          "text": "一起往前嗎？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "推進之王",
          "speakerToken": "char_112_seige_1",
          "operatorId": "char_112_seige",
          "portraitKey": "char_112_seige",
          "text": "是的，確定有你們同行，我也能打起精神了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "推進之王",
          "speakerToken": "char_112_seige_1",
          "operatorId": "char_112_seige",
          "portraitKey": "char_112_seige",
          "text": "我希望，前方等待著我們的答案都不至於太糟糕......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "推進之王",
          "speakerToken": "char_112_seige_1",
          "operatorId": "char_112_seige",
          "portraitKey": "char_112_seige",
          "text": "至少，無論如何，我會努力用錘子把它錘出個過得去的模樣。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "攝政王",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_062",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "他們是否都到了？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赦罪師",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_055",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "快了，殿下，食腐者之王與血魔大君將在三日內抵達倫蒂尼姆。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "攝政王",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_062",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "自從王庭重新聚首，我們薩卡茲正處於內戰後最接近統一的階段。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "攝政王",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_062",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "不能讓任何勢力擋在我們面前。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赦罪師",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_055",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "說起其他勢力，殿下，那名來自小丘郡的使者至今仍在倫蒂尼姆。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "攝政王",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_062",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "這件事已有結論。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赦罪師",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_055",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "正如殿下先前說的那樣，他們並非真心想要結盟。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赦罪師",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_055",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "一個有誠意的盟友，不會把自己藏在幕後，連半張臉都不露，只把一個半瘋半傻的僕人丟到我們面前。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赦罪師",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_055",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "她不可能得到想要的，卻並沒有就此離去。她帶來的部隊，在倫蒂尼姆外圍與貴族殘黨和當地居民發生了多次衝突。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "攝政王",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_062",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "試探。他們想刺探倫蒂尼姆的現狀，同時評估我們的實力。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赦罪師",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_055",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "是的，殿下，如果我們表現得軟弱，她背後的人將會提前入局。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赦罪師",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_055",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "而如果我們態度強硬，她就是一枚失去價值的棄子，被剪除了也並不可惜。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "攝政王",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_062",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "想讓薩卡茲當刀子的陰謀家，最後都會死於刀下。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "攝政王",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_062",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "她甚至不及塔露拉。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赦罪師",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_055",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "雖然有著相近的血脈，但深池的領袖與塔露拉截然不同。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赦罪師",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_055",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "與整合運動相比，深池在南部掀起的波瀾，足以證明他們有足夠的武力，做好了或者正在做著撕扯維多利亞的準備。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "攝政王",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_062",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "一群趁亂獲利的人，只有在混亂到達頂點時，才會現身。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "攝政王",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_062",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "現階段，只要和我們眼前的目標和薩卡茲無關，無論他們在外面有何謀劃，都不值得我關心。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "攝政王",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_062",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "但是在倫蒂尼姆，我不允許節外生枝。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "攝政王",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_062",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "讓曼弗雷德順帶把這事處理了。應付那些貴族對他來說太簡單，他需要儘快成長。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赦罪師",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_055",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "曼弗雷德向來知道你的想法，他已經做好了準備。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "攝政王",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_062",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "還不夠。羅德島有什麼新動向？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赦罪師",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_055",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "這幾個月，他們沒有停止過正常的、表面上的“商業活動”。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赦罪師",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_055",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "那艘陸上艦船在去年年底駛離卡西米爾以後，曾多次靠近維多利亞，但並沒有長時間脫離過我們的視線。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "攝政王",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_062",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "只要他們靠近倫蒂尼姆......不，只要那幾個人進入維多利亞， 立刻向我彙報。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "攝政王",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_062",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "或者，你可以直接向她報告。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赦罪師",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_055",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "當然，殿下——薩卡茲的王，自然知道該如何去回收屬於她的冠冕。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
